Native Acceleration Runtime
---------------------------

OpenRAW's Nikon decoder and OpenCL render kernels are project-authored.
Numba/llvmlite compile the decoder, and PyOpenCL runs the kernels on available
devices. These are general-purpose runtimes, not third-party RAW decoders.
Windows bundles must retain their complete installed license/third-party notices
under THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES, together with those for pytools, platformdirs, and
typing_extensions.

The PyOpenCL dependency siphash24 is used under its Apache-2.0 option. Its
license and upstream attribution are retained under THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES/siphash24.
